{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18481","headline":"李评事公进示文集因赠之 · 欧阳詹","name":"李评事公进示文集因赠之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风雅不坠地，五言始君先。\n希微嘉会章，杳冥河梁篇。\n理蔓语无枝，言一意则千。\n往来更後人，浇荡醨前源。\n倾筐实不收，朴樕华争繁。\n大教护微旨，哲人生令孙。\n高飙激颓波，坐使横流翻。\n昔日越重阻，侧聆沧海传。\n逮兹觌清扬，幸覩青琅编。\n泠泠中山醇，片片崑丘璠。\n一杯有余味，再览增光鲜。\n对宝人皆鉴，握鞶良自妍。\n吾其告先师，六义今还全。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}